&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
 Hello {!recordId.Core_End_Customer_Account_Id__r.Owner.FirstName},
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;  
A deal has been submitted for review and you are listed as the Account Executive for the end customer.   Upon deal approval, you will be listed as part of the opportunity team, providing the ability to monitor the deal through the sales cycle.
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Registration Number: &lt;/b&gt;{!recordId.Name} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Deal Registration Name: &lt;/b&gt;{!recordId.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Partner Account: &lt;/b&gt;{!recordId.Core_Partner_Account_Id__r.Name}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;End Customer Account: &lt;/b&gt;{!recordId.Core_End_Customer_Account_Id__r.Name}  
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
For more details, you can access the deal registration record &lt;a href=https://intel--crmqa7.sandbox.lightning.force.com/{!recordId.Id}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
